    seoTitle: "Message Match Landing Page Guide (2026): Ad-to-Page Consistency",
    description: "A message match landing page repeats the ad's hook, offer and proof above the fold. The five elements, how to audit your account, and before-and-after examples.",
    category: 'Advertising',
